  {
   "evidence": "`FiberCast.lean:43` has `def fiberCast {a b : X} (h : a = b) : E a \u2243L[R] E b`. `FiberCast.lean:48` has `mk_fiberCast ... TotalSpace.mk' F b (fiberCast h w) = TotalSpace.mk' F a w`. The `FiberCast.lean` docstring says fiber casts let 'a frame along one map be read as a frame along another map with the same values'.",
